IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Mi piacerebbe piantare qualche
fiore vicino a casa mia.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:000B:}}Mmmh{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Non ho ancora deciso di che colore!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Are you a gardener, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Then I hope you plant a lot of fruit
trees!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Te va la jardinería, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}¡Tú planta muchos árboles frutales
que yo te digo si dan buenos frutos!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}T'as la main verte, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Si oui, j'espère que tu planteras
beaucoup d'arbres fruitiers !

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hai il pollice verde, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Allora spero proprio che pianterai
un sacco di alberi da frutto!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Gärtnerst du auch, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Dann hoffe ich, dass du auch alles
voller Obstbäume pflanzt!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bahçe işleriyle aran iyi mi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bir sürü meyve ağacı diktin mi?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Meyve ağacı dikmek kesinlikle sevaptır.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Plants are great, and they heal your
soul.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Fruit trees are especially great,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
'cause they fill your belly too!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Il giardinaggio rilassa il corpo
e la mente! Adoro le piante!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Soprattutto gli alberi da frutto!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Evviva le scorpacciate di frutta!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Bitkiler harika; insanın ruhunu iyileştiriyor.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0004:}}
Meyve ağaçları daha da harika,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} çünkü
karnını da doyuruyor!
